<title>FRANCE: No immediate Alcatel reaction to GEC.</title>
<headline>No immediate Alcatel reaction to GEC.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcatel Alsthom had no immediate comment on a statement by Britain's General Electric Co Plc that it was in talks with Alcatel to determine the future of their GEC Alsthom joint rail and power venture.</p>
<p>GEC, reporting its full-year results, said in a statement that it was embarking on a new strategy, moving away from a joint venture culture towards a GEC-managed group focused on defence and aerospace, industrial electronics and communications.</p>
<p>A spokesman for Alcatel said the group had no immediate comment.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
